WEBVTT

15:31.665 --> 15:33.709
Try not to stab your sister with it.

15:33.834 --> 15:35.461
(CHUCKLES)

15:42.676 --> 15:46.597
If you're going to own a sword,
you'd better know how to use it.

15:46.722 --> 15:49.183
(DOOR OPENS, CLOSES)

15:49.808 --> 15:51.810
(CAWING)

15:54.396 --> 15:58.150
Don't listen to it. Crows are all liars.
